	<section_number>8.01-525.8</section_number>
	<catch_line>Resignation of trustee</catch_line>
	<text>
		The trustee may resign at any time after accounting for all funds in his possession, and the court may appoint another trustee.
	</text>
	<history>1936, p. 524; Michie Code 1942, § 5278i; Code 1950, § 55-163; 2019, c. 712.</history>
